to\nthe lightcone momenta n and \
nb.\n\nLightConePerpendicularComponent[Momentum[p],Momentum[n],Momentum[nb]] \
denotes\nthe perpendicular component of the 4-momentum p with respect to the \
lightcone\nmomenta n and nb."
 
