QuantumField /: QuantumField::usage = "QuantumField is the head of quantized \
fields and their derivatives.\n\nQuantumField[par, ftype, {lorind}, {sunind}] \
denotes a quantum field of type\nftype with (possible) Lorentz-indices lorind \
and $SU(N)$ indices sunind. The\noptional first argument par denotes a \
partial derivative acting on the field."
 
