product.\n\nSPD[a, b] is transformed into ScalarProduct[a, b,Dimension->D] \
by\nFeynCalcInternal.\n\nSPD[p] is the same as SPD[p,p] $(=p^2)$."
 
Attributes[SPE] = {Orderless}
 
(SPE[FeynCalc`SharedObjects`Private`a_, FeynCalc`SharedObjects`Private`b_] = 
