renaming dummy indices in the final result, timing: ", 
         N[AbsoluteTime[] - FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`time, 4], 
         FCDoControl -> FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`ccjVerbose]; 
        FCPrint[3, "ComplexConjugate: After FCRenameDummyIndices: ", 
         FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`res, FCDoControl -> 
          FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`ccjVerbose]]; 
      If[FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`optConjugate =!= {} && 
        Head[FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`optConjugate] === List, 
       FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`ccRules = 
         Union[Cases[FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`optConjugate, 
           (Rule | RuleDelayed)[_, _]]]; 
        FeynCalc`ComplexConjugate`Private`optConjugate = 
