PairContract /: PairContract::usage = "PairContract is like Pair, but with \
(local) contraction properties. The\nfunction fully supports the BMHV algebra \
and will expand momenta inside scalar\nproducts when it leads to simpler \
expressions.\n\nPairContract is an auxiliary function used in higher level \
FeynCalc functions\nthat require fast contractions between multiple \
expressions, where Contract\nwould be too slow."
 
