LCD /: LCD::usage = "LCD[m, n, r, s] evaluates to $D$-dimensional \
$\\varepsilon^{m n r s}$ by virtue\nof applying \
FeynCalcInternal.\n\nLCD[m,...][p, ...] evaluates to $D$-dimensional \
$\\epsilon ^{m \\ldots \\mu\n\\ldots}p_{\\mu \\ldots}$ applying \
FeynCalcInternal.\n\nWhen some indices of a Levi-Civita-tensor are contracted \
with 4-vectors,\nFeynCalc suppresses explicit dummy indices by putting those \
vectors into the\ncorresponding index slots. For example,  $\\varepsilon^{p_1 \
p_2 p_3 p_4}$\n(accessible via LCD[][p1,p2,p3,p4]) correspond to \
$\\varepsilon_{\\mu \\nu \\rho\n\\sigma} p_1^\\mu p_2^\\nu p_3^\\rho \
p_4^\\sigma$."
 
CLC /: MakeBoxes[CLC[FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`x___][
       FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`y___], TraditionalForm] := 
     ToBoxes[Eps[Sequence @@ CartesianIndex /@ 
          {FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`x}, 
        Sequence @@ CartesianMomentum /@ 
          {FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`y}], TraditionalForm] /; 
      Length[{FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`x, 
         FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`y}] === 3
 
