        D - 1], CartesianIndex[FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`b, 
        D - 1], CartesianIndex[FeynCalc`SharedObjectsTypesetting`Private`c, 
        D - 1]], TraditionalForm]
 
CLCD /: CLCD::usage = "CLCD[m, n, r]  evaluates to Eps[CartesianIndex[m, \
D-1], CartesianIndex[n,\nD-1], CartesianIndex[r,D-1]] applying \
FeynCalcInternal.\n\nCLC[m,...][p, ...] evaluates to Eps[CartesianIndex[m, \
D-1], ...,\nCartesianMomentum[p, D-1], ...] applying \
FeynCalcInternal.\n\nWhen some indices of a Levi-Civita-tensor are contracted \
with 3-vectors,\nFeynCalc suppresses explicit dummy indices by putting those \
vectors into the\ncorresponding index slots. For example,  $\\varepsilon^{p_1 \
p_2 p_3}$\n(accessible via CLCD[][p1,p2,p3]) correspond to $\\varepsilon^{i j \
k} p_1^i\np_2^j p_3^k$."
 
