vectors n and nb.\nIt corresponds to $g^{\\mu \\nu}_{\\perp}$.\n\nIf one \
omits n and nb, the program will use default vectors specified \
via\n$FCDefaultLightconeVectorN and $FCDefaultLightconeVectorNB."
 
