properties. It wraps the head\nSUNFIndex around its arguments."
 
FeynCalc`FeynCalcExternal`Private`scalarmul[
     (FeynCalc`FeynCalcExternal`Private`a_)*
      (FeynCalc`FeynCalcExternal`Private`b_), 
