FCLoopBasisCreateScalarProducts /: FCLoopBasisCreateScalarProducts::usage = "\
FCLoopBasisCreateScalarProducts {q1, q2, ...}, {p1, p2, ...}, {d1, d2, \
...},\nhead] generates a list of all loop-momentum dependent scalar products \
made out\nof the loop momenta q1, q2, ... and external momenta p1, p2, ... in \
the\nspace-time dimensions d1, d2, .... The argument head can be Pair to \
generate\nLorentzian scalar products or CartesianPair to generate Cartesian \
scalar\nproducts."
 
FCLoopBasisGetSize[(FeynCalc`FCLoopBasisGetSize`Private`lmoms_Integer)?
      Positive, (FeynCalc`FCLoopBasisGetSize`Private`emoms_Integer)?
